# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
# Exception: a shared debug keystore is intentionally committed so all
# contributors' debug APKs sign with the same SHA-1 (needed for Google
# Sign-In to work from any machine without re-registering each dev's SHA-1).
# Safe because this is a class project with no release/Play distribution.
!keystore/debug.keystore
